sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant I as InterviewHandler
  participant PL as Planner
  participant G as Gemini Flash
  participant V as PlanValidator
  participant PG as PreviewGenerator
  participant NB as Nano Banana 2
  participant GS as GuidanceService
  I->>PL: build(session)
  PL->>G: items + zones + rules (JSON schema)
  G-->>PL: placements + steps
  PL->>V: validate(plan)
  alt violations
    V-->>PL: repaired plan
  end
  PL-->>I: plan
  I-->>U: numbered steps + call number + /s/:id link
  I-)PG: generate(photo, plan) async
  PG->>NB: edit photo, rearrange only, add nothing
  NB-->>PG: after image (or timeout at 30 s)
  PG-->>U: preview labeled "Illustration"
  Note over U,GS: later, during guidance
  U->>GS: "A is full"
  GS->>PL: replan(session, blocker)
  PL->>G: undone items only
  G-->>PL: new placements
  PL->>V: validate
  GS-->>U: "Moved 3 and 6 to the drawer since A is full"
